content.text:
Now CSS. This is a big file. Need quality. Let's carefully design.

Root:
```
:root{ --ink:#04050a; --ink2:#0a0b14; --paper:#f4ecdf; --paper-dim:#a9a498; --red:#ff3d55; --red-deep:#c01732; --cyan:#6ef7ea; --gold:#ffcf7a; --serif:"Palatino Linotype",...; --sans:"Inter",...; --jp:...}
```
Reset. body background black, overflow hidden, overscroll none. #app fixed inset 0. canvas width/height 100% display block.

UI scale: use clamp.

HUD:
```
#hud { position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none; opacity:0; transition: opacity .4s; }
#hud.visible{opacity:1}
.hud-left{position:absolute; top:max(18px, env(safe-area-inset-top)); left:max(22px, env(safe-area-inset-left)); display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;}
.hud-sigil{font-family:jp; font-size:34px; color:rgba(255,60,80,.8); ... border:1px solid rgba(255,60,80,.25); width:52px;height:64px; display grid; background...}
.hud-bars width: min(280px, 32vw)
.bar-label font-family sans; font-size 9px; letter-spacing .2em; color #bdb6a7; display flex justify-content space-between; margin-bottom 4px
.bar height 9px; background rgba(255,255,255,.06); border 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); clip-path polygon(0 0, 100% 0, calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%);
.bar > div height 100%; transition width .12s linear; background linear-gradient(90deg,#8c1024,#ff3d55 60%,#ff8a7a); box-shadow 0 0 12px rgba(255,61,85,.5); 
#focus-fill background cyan/gold gradient; width 0.
.bar-ticks background repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 18px, rgba(0,0,0,.4) 18px 20px); mix-blend? overlay.
focus ready class on #focus-bar: animation glow.
dash row display flex; font 8px; dash-track flex1 height3 background; #dash-fill width 100% background cyan; transform-origin left; set transform scaleX.
```
JS sets `focusBar.classList.toggle('ready', focus>=100)`.

HUD right:
```
top same; right 22; text-align right;
.score font-family serif; font-size clamp(26px,3vw,40px); letter-spacing .08em; color paper; text-shadow red glow; line-height 1;
.score-label 9px letter-spacing .3em color dim
.best-line 9px; wave-label margin-top 8px; font-size 10px; letter-spacing .25em; color red/paper border...
.hud-actions display flex gap 6; justify-content flex-end; margin-top 8; pointer-events:auto
```
Wave label maybe above score? Design: score top, best below, wave pill. Fine.

Boss bar: `position:absolute; top: 18px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); width:min(560px,46vw); opacity:0; transition;` `.visible{opacity:1}`; boss-label flex space-between; name serif 15px with red; kicker 8px letterspacing; boss-track height 10px with segmented border; fill width 100%, gradient #ff3d55 -> #ffcf7a? boss blood red. Boss ticks repeating. phase classes adjust color.

But boss bar at top-center may collide with score; on mobile, width 42vw, okay.

Combo:
```
position:absolute; right:max(24px); top:38%; text-align:right; opacity:0; transform scale(.8); transition; 
.combo.show{opacity:1; transform:scale(1)}
.combo.pop animation comboPop .25s
.combo-num span font-family serif; font-size clamp(40px,5vw,68px); color paper; text-shadow red; line-height .8;
.combo-num em display block font-size 9px letter-spacing .3em color #d7c6b0;
.combo-mult font-family serif; font-size 22px; color gold; letter-spacing .05em;
```
Hints:
```
bottom 30px center; display flex gap 18px; font 9px letterspacing .15em color rgba(220,210,190,.6); kbd styled border bottom.
opacity 0; .show opacity1; transition .6s.
```
On mobile hide hints? UI shows touch-specific maybe. Keep hidden via CSS on touch? We'll handle content.

Mobile controls:
```
position absolute inset 0; pointer-events none; display none; z-index 20;
body.touch.playing .mobile-controls{display:block}
.joystick {position absolute; left: max(20px,env...); bottom: max(20px,...); width:140px;height:140px; pointer-events:auto; touch-action:none}
.joy-ring absolute inset 12px border-radius 50%; border 1px solid rgba(110,247,234,.25); background radial-gradient(circle, rgba(10,20,30,.35), rgba(5,8,15,.15)); box-shadow inset 0 0 30px...
.joy-cross ... lines
.joy-knob width 54;height54; left 43px; top43px; border-radius 50%; border 1px solid rgba(110,247,234,.7); background radial-gradient(...); box-shadow 0 0 20px ...
.joy-label bottom -? ; font-size 8; letter-spacing .25em; color dim; text-align center; position absolute bottom -4px; width 100%.
.joystick.active .joy-ring border-color rgba(255,61,85,.5)
```
Button cluster:
```
.action-cluster {position:absolute; right:max(22px,...); bottom:max(24px,...); width:230px;height:200px; pointer-events:none}
.action-btn {position:absolute; border-radius:50%; pointer-events:auto; touch-action:none; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, rgba(40,45,60,.85), rgba(8,9,15,.9)); color paper; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:78;height:78; box-shadow ...; backdrop-filter blur(4px);}
.action-btn .jp{font-family:jp; font-size:24px; color...}
.action-btn small{font-size:7px; letter-spacing .12em; color dim}
.attack{width:96;height:96; right:0; bottom:0; border-color rgba(255,61,85,.55); background radial-gradient(...red);}
.attack .jp{font-size:32px;color:#ffe6e0}
.jump{right:96px;bottom:26px;width:72;height:72}
.dash{right:20px;bottom:104px;width:66;height:66; border-color cyan}
.burst{right:110px;bottom:112px;width:60;height:60; border-color gold; opacity:.4; transition}
body.burst-ready .burst{opacity:1; animation burstGlow 1.2s infinite}
.pressed{transform:scale(.92); filter:brightness(1.3)}
```
Careful positions overlapping attack. Use a cluster grid:
- attack big at right 8 bottom 8 (96)
- jump at right 112 bottom 8 (72)
- dash at right 38 bottom 112 (66)
- burst at right 120 bottom 106 (58)
Maybe better layout diamond:
 attack bottom-right 100px; jump left of attack; dash above attack; burst above-left. Fine.

Mobile landscape height 390: joystick 120, buttons scale .9. Use media max-height 500: sizes reduce.

Screens:
```
.screen {position:absolute; inset:0; opacity:0; visibility:hidden; pointer-events:none; transition:opacity .45s, visibility .45s; z-index:30; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;}
.screen.active{opacity:1;visibility:visible;pointer-events:auto}
.menu-screen{background: transparent; justify-content:flex-start; ...}
.menu-shade{position:absolute; inset:0; background:radial-gradient(120% 120% at 15% 50%, rgba(3,4,9,.96) 0%, rgba(3,4,9,.8) 38%, rgba(3,4,9,.25) 72%, rgba(3,4,9,.55) 100%), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(3,4,9,.55), transparent 60%);}
.menu-wrap{position:relative; z-index:2; padding-left: clamp(28px,7vw,112px); max-width: 720px; ...}
```
Need menu vertical centering: screen flex align center; `.menu-wrap` with display flex column, margin-top maybe.

Menu kicker small letterspacing .35em; display flex align center gap 12; color #c8b9a8; font-size 10px; rule 40px line.

Title block display flex; title-jp writing-mode vertical-rl? Use `<div class=title-jp>影<br>忍</div>` with font-size 20px; line-height 1.6; margin-right 18px; color rgba(255,61,85,.75); border-right 1px solid red; padding-right 12; writing? just block. Add letter-spacing.

Game title line-height .78; margin 0; font-family serif; font-weight 400; transform skew? Use no skew. text-transform uppercase.
Title line font-size clamp(64px, 10vw, 132px); letter-spacing .035em.
Accent color transparent gradient. Add `-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08)` maybe.
Title shadow: `.title-line:first-child{ color:#f6eee2; text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(170,20,50,.55), 0 0 40px rgba(255,90,100,.12);}`
Accent gradient + glow: `background: linear-gradient(180deg,#fff2e6 0%,#ff8a70 35%,#e51c3f 70%,#780a1f 100%); -webkit-background-clip:text; color:transparent; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(255,40,70,.3));`
Add diagonal slash pseudo on title block maybe.

Tagline font-family serif italic? "The shogun's blade..." color #b8aa98; font-size 15; letter-spacing .06em; margin 20px 0 32px.

Menu actions display flex align center gap 24.
Primary button:
```
